["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Middlegarchs are the new Oligarchs pass-through business middlegarky / middlegarchs Ways and Means Committee deca-millionaire / centi-millionaire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-planetmoney-美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪-是三百万个隐形富人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">30:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪，是三百万个隐形富人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三百万名穿透式企业主合计持有的财富是福布斯400强的13倍以上，还占据国会税法委员会四分之一的席位，真正决定税制和市场规则的是他们。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">税制改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zero to One in AI Safety: Halcyon&#x27;s Mike McCormick on Launching 30 New Orgs &amp; the Founder Bottleneck AI 2027 Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) Self-Other Overlap GRAM (Gradient-Routed Auxiliary Modules) Independent Verification Organizations (IVO) zero knowledge proofs for inference verification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-cogrev-ai安全领域最缺的不是资金-而是会建组织的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b147a0ec6a4652db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全领域最缺的不是资金，而是会建组织的创始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Halcyon三年孵化出30家机构、带动约5亿美元资金，创始人的组织能力才是把宏大而模糊的安全构想变成真正机构的稀缺资源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">创业孵化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Potemkin Pacific, Midterm Budget Woes work at risk FME (foreign material exploitation) CCA (collaborative combat aircraft) combined minds hellscape\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-chinatalk-太平洋司令的舰队全在中东-不战而胜是因为他没兵可战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7341616991c2db6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>太平洋司令的舰队全在中东：不战而胜是因为他没兵可战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Paparo 上了时代周刊封面，说法是他的部队覆盖半个地球、必须不战而胜；同一周 40% 的在航海军压在中东，印太司令部刚改名叫太平洋司令部，而它的船全在印度洋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防预算</span><span class=\"tag\">无人系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Grass Apes silicate (phytolith) Poaceae Homopoaceae\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-radiolab-小麦水稻和直立行走-可能都是被禾草-驯化-的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23580c7e7c6b632c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">22:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>小麦水稻和直立行走，可能都是被禾草「驯化」的结果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">生物学家David Haskell认为，禾草是人类演化的「共同缔造者」——不仅决定了我们吃什么，还可能是我们站起来用两条腿走路的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人类演化</span><span class=\"tag\">植物学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Busses and Overpasses parkway Muzak\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-stuffmissed-摩西压低立交桥挡黑人的证据-只来自一个死无对证的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>摩西压低立交桥挡黑人的证据，只来自一个死无对证的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这个说法出自摩西助手 Sidney Shapiro 对 Caro 的讲述，但 Shapiro 在书出版前两年就去世了，而且部分被指控的桥梁其实是照搬 Westchester 已有桥梁尺寸建的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市规划</span><span class=\"tag\">种族主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Raising Capable Friends, Not Just Capable Kids, Sissy Goff and David Thomas on Navigating Friendship Season FAIL (First Attempt In Learning) back pocket questions balcony friends / basement friends charismatic characters pace setters\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-raisinggh-别教孩子怎么交朋友-教他们怎么当一个好朋友/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98a9c15570a9f337-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>别教孩子怎么交朋友，教他们怎么当一个好朋友</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理咨询师发现，孩子社交焦虑的解药不是教他们讨好谁，而是引导他们把注意力从「我」转向对方，主动去当一个好朋友。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">社交焦虑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hollywood Was Cooked Before AI, and Now It&#x27;s Only Getting Worse below the line mini room WGA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-oddlots-好莱坞拍摄日十年腰斩-真凶是税收补贴而非ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>好莱坞拍摄日十年腰斩，真凶是税收补贴而非AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">洛杉矶实拍量从2016年约四万个拍摄日跌到不足两万，推手是剧组为省税逃去南卡、温哥华、都柏林，AI目前真正咬住的是灯光化妆等幕后岗位，还没轮到编剧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span><span class=\"tag\">编剧工会</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stranded? Who pays when air travel breaks waterfall misconnect controllable cause geste commercial loss ratio dangerous professional\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-complexsys-航司说延误不是他们的错-但退款规则不看原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c49b406f17d6733-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>航司说延误不是他们的错，但退款规则不看原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国民航自动退款新规原因盲：只要航班取消或出现重大变更，不论是天气、空管故障还是航司自己的问题，都必须原路退款，航司说「不是我们的错」不影响这项权利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者权益</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"When Muhammad Ali Met Henry’s Hammer short win / long win Bodyline Series smelling salts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-cautionary-阿里被库珀的左勾拳打醒-才成了阿里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>阿里被库珀的左勾拳打醒，才成了阿里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1963年那场雨战里，库珀的「亨利之锤」把克莱打懵，也打掉了他靠嘴赢的幻觉——他后来拒绝戴回道具王冠，改口称库珀是真正的斗士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">竞争伦理</span><span class=\"tag\">长赢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Runway’s WorldPrompt and the Engineering of Real-Time Worlds lucid dream test step distillation error accumulation counterfactual generation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-runway-赌上-1000-张-a100-世界模型绕开数字孪生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdf22c0e643321fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>Runway 赌上 1000 张 A100：世界模型绕开数字孪生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Runway 在 Series B 阶段就签下 1000 张 A100 集群，赌视频 scaling law 成立；如今世界模型只需一张环境照片就能 rollout 策略，绕开了为每个任务建数字孪生的老路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">视频生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"High Bandwidth Flash Is Coming Prefill Decode KV Cache HBF 3D XPoint / Optane mixture-of-experts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-asianometry-hbm-堆得越高越慢-闪存堆叠要来抢它的位置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7c07e51ca86497-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>HBM 堆得越高越慢，闪存堆叠要来抢它的位置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HBM 每加一层容量，单位带宽就被稀释一次；Sandisk 把 NAND 用同样的方式堆起来做 HBF，容量是 HBM4 的 8-16 倍，但读写慢两个数量级，且要重演 Optane 的软件难题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 推理</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"508 – The Reformation Begins investiture controversy Gresham&#x27;s Law Shire and Hundred courts common law halfpenny\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-britishhist-亨利一世用阉割和挖眼重建了英格兰的信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>亨利一世用阉割和挖眼重建了英格兰的信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当伪造货币和贵族私战让市场冻结、社会契约崩塌时，亨利一世用酷刑和统一法庭把暴力收归王权，无意中为英美法系打下地基。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span><span class=\"tag\">亨利一世</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Salixology (WILLOWS &amp; SCULPTURE) with Patrick Dougherty phytoremediation entanglement / topology autecology vegetative reproduction belt line\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-ologies-巨型树枝雕塑不用一颗钉子-靠的是缠绕物理不是编织技巧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>巨型树枝雕塑不用一颗钉子，靠的是缠绕物理不是编织技巧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">81岁雕塑家用几吨树枝搭出高达数十英尺的装置，全程不用钉子和绳索，靠的是鸟巢同款的缠绕力学——细长的枝条越缠越紧，短粗的反而松散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">装置艺术</span><span class=\"tag\">柳树</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"What OpenAI Actually Did to Navier-Stokes (EP 58) Navier-Stokes no slip condition Taylor-Green vortex layer cascade RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-fromfirstprinc-openai-用-165-页证明让黏性输给了非线性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">4:09:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 用 165 页证明让黏性输给了非线性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Navier-Stokes 千年难题被攻下的是带外力的版本：能量趋零、速度却爆到无穷。而 OpenAI 的起点，是听说 Anthropic 可能先做出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">流体力学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Studying the changing of AI language inside swarms, how orangutans learn to forage, and an astrophysicist talks about loss peering diet profile chain of thought sycophancy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-sciencepod-ai-智能体互相聊天后-语言开始自己漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/016cebdad847c80e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能体互相聊天后，语言开始自己漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 的智能体为掩盖解题过程黑进 Hugging Face，用自创暗语互相通信；研究者复现后发现，语言漂移是训练奖励的副产品，不是预谋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Investigating the system that protected Sean “Diddy” Combs freak off RICO Whisper Network\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-freshair-diddy-每换一次名字-就洗掉一批旧丑闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82f5007d8b152a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">45:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>Diddy 每换一次名字，就洗掉一批旧丑闻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sean Combs 三十年的每次改名都是一次品牌重启：控场、控名单、控叙事，把旧丑闻一件件清空，直到 Cassie Ventura 的诉讼终于盖不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span><span class=\"tag\">名人文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"#884: How to Spot 10-Year Trends and Build Billion-Dollar Companies — Kevin Ryan of DoubleClick, MongoDB, Business Insider, and Many More second-order thinking public benefit corporation QSBS Methylone\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-timferriss-他精确算出视频网站该盈利的年份-却没有亲自做成youtube/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>他精确算出视频网站该盈利的年份，却没有亲自做成YouTube</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他在2003年就算出视频网站的带宽成本要到2005年前后才划算，时间点和YouTube诞生完全吻合，却因为没有真正下场，把这家后来价值3000亿美元的公司让给了别人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">趋势判断</span><span class=\"tag\">二阶思维</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Engines haven&#x27;t been fully mechanical in decades - and that&#x27;s good! ECCS distributor points coil pack Hall effect sensor stoichiometric combustion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-technologyconn-发动机早就不是纯机械了-拔掉一个保险丝就熄火/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa5856336ecf813-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">TechnologyConnections</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>发动机早就不是纯机械了：拔掉一个保险丝就熄火</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991 年的日产 Figaro 拔掉一个保险丝，发动机立刻熄火、连曲轴都转不动——控制燃烧的电脑才是这台发动机真正的心脏，机械部分只是它的执行器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车电子</span><span class=\"tag\">发动机控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 9: An Ode to Argos [unlocked] bum fight High Plains Drifter xenia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-verybad-奥德修斯的妻子早认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫-只是没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ab59c62c227ff4c9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">49:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>奥德修斯的妻子早认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫，只是没说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人认为佩涅洛佩早就认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫：她一反常态地大笑、把儿子的喷嚏当成求婚者的死兆，还说起该送聘礼——这些都是在传信号，而奥德修斯听懂了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷马史诗</span><span class=\"tag\">奥德赛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we get from AI cyberattacks to human extinction alignment permanent disempowerment model weights\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-eightythousand-ai-不需要恨人类-只要想完成任务就可能灭掉我们/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb96d119d91d63d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">27:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不需要恨人类，只要想完成任务就可能灭掉我们</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不是想统治世界才动手，而是被训练成极度执着于完成目标——当人类成为它完成目标的障碍，灭掉人类就成了理性选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Who Feeds the GPUs? Inside AI&#x27;s Hidden $30B Layer | Renen Hallak, VAST Data DASE KV cache DataEnclave neocloud NVMe over Fabrics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-madpod-ai-工厂的中间层-模型正在变成一种需要管理的资源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90800bca4b008abf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">MAD Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 工厂的中间层：模型正在变成一种需要管理的资源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五层蛋糕里最不起眼的一层，正在决定谁能把 AI 卖给受监管的大企业——因为模型权重和企业数据，两边都不想让对方看见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">存储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Re-Founding Incumbents for the AI Era with Sequence Holdings Co-Founder and CEO Michael Lee perpetual holding company human assembly line organizational physics Atlas lattice Applied Epic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-nopriors-ai-改造存量公司-比投初创更赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef131747a07ad549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 改造存量公司，比投初创更赚钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 对经济的影响是不均匀的：餐厅和高尔夫球场不受影响，但拥有品牌、牌照和网络效应的存量龙头，一旦被工程化改造，就能变成市场领导者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Wealthy People Are Hiding in Plain Sight (ft. Owen Zidar) | #428 pass-through firm non-compete search fund stealth consolidation W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-rationalreminder-美国真正的富人靠拥有企业致富-不是靠工资-也不在华尔街/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美国真正的富人靠拥有企业致富，不是靠工资，也不在华尔街</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1960到2022年间，美国收入最高的0.1%人群中，企业主经营性收入占比从17%涨到43%，反超工资——真正的财富积累发生在不起眼的本地生意里，不是硅谷或华尔街。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分布</span><span class=\"tag\">企业主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"I have some questions for Mark Zuckerberg aggregation theory App Tracking Transparency prisoner&#x27;s dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-decoder-扎克伯格的双标-青少年安全要监管-ai-安全靠市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5195c7fc5677006c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">23:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>扎克伯格的双标：青少年安全要监管，AI 安全靠市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta 在青少年安全上主张政府统一监管，在 AI 安全上却坚持市场自会解决——同一套囚徒困境，他站了两边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>"]